, validate required fields and passwords, consolidate message display into a showMsg helper, and persist users to localStorage under \"MyUsersList\". register.js now builds user objects with firstName/lastName/email/password, clears inputs and redirects to signin after success. signin.js validates inputs, looks up users by email and password, shows messages, and redirects on successful login. These changes fix previous field-name mismatches and make client-side auth handling more robust.", "created_at": "2026-02-03T10:41:31Z", "repo": "yoga-pilates-booking-system", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9a1dae1abd54523dd52bac7ba2116adfd6ec9129", "message": "Add post-action redirects for auth pages\n\nAutomatically redirect users after authentication actions to improve UX. register.js: after clearing the registration form, redirect to ./signin.html after a 1s delay. signin.js: after login flow, redirect to ./index.html after a 1s delay (both implemented with setTimeout).", "created_at": "2026-02-03T10:37:52Z", "repo": "yoga-pilates-booking-system", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "27cde9447b6eebc012aa4cc381450005f9ee3a7f", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-11-26T11:40:04Z", "repo": "yoga-pilates-booking-system", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "130e9540dc2424e78ab96a46844d5d533f8d480e", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-11-23T10:59:28Z", "repo": "yoga-pilates-booking-system", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b1dfc4c5052fabe99712f5d63ad047c5588db198", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-11-16T14:15:51Z", "repo": "yoga-pilates-booking-system", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1b84a632826005a27e07248f4f8dae0688b4e630", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-10-31T14:59:07Z", "repo": "yoga-p